{
  "id": 1053,
  "description": "MAIN ROLES:\nAlchemist=MainPotato\nCooks=PotatoMines, PotatoIII, PotatoSmelt\nFishers=MainPotato, PotatoesGirl, PotatoRocker\n\nSIDE ROLES:\nSmelter=PotatoSmelt\nWoodCutters=PotatoesGirl\nMiners=PotatoMines\n\nSTORAGE ROLES:\nGold=MainPotato \nCreature Goods=MainPotato\nOre/Bars=PotatoSmelt\nWood=PotatoesGirl\nAlchemy Gems=PotatoMines\nFood=PotatoIII\nUpgrade Gems=PotatoMines\n\nIf you need any materials, or have extra you don&#039;t wish to store yourself, please send them to the above characters. If you need any materials for crafting, we have plenty to share, just message myself (MainPotato or PotatoesGirl) and we&#039;d be happy to send you whatever you&#039;d like! We share everything in this small little community. Inventory and bank space is rather tight and limited, and this is our way of trying to organize all the items in the game so we have a small stockpile on hand at all times. \n\nMainPotato is our primarily NPC seller with a high bartering skill, so if youd like the most out of your finished goods outside of the market, send them to him and I&#039;ll send you back the gold i gain from the sale. Our primary good is Cooked Lantern Fish, so that&#039;s mostly what you&#039;ll see MainPotato&#039;s and PotatoesGirl&#039;s accounts crafting, so we may save up gold for everyone to have. Right now we are spending quite a bit trying to get challenges done so we can build various guild buildings to increase our overall power and productivity as a group. \n\nThank you!\n~MainPotato &amp; PotatoesGirl",
